                <pb facs="0467" n="363" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg363"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.13/18.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 20, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Because of a constitutional technicality the Senate yesterday rejected House
                    amnesty bill.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
